Building your own AI coding agent from scratch.
CopenhagenJS talk by @mlfrg, Jan 2026.

LIVE: https://vibe-coding-agent-talk.vercel.app

RUN LOCALLY:
  cd slides && bun install && bun --hot src/index.ts

STACK: bun, react 19, tailwind, motion


HOW THIS WAS MADE:

1. voice recording
   raw stream of consciousness in russian
   just talked through ideas into the mic
   -> first-thoughts-rec-ru-raw.md

2. ai cleanup
   fed the transcript to claude
   got a structured draft back
   -> first-thoughts-cleaned.md

3. outline
   detailed slide-by-slide breakdown
   timings, slide types, demo ideas
   -> presentation-outline.md

4. practice run
   recorded myself going through slides
   noted what to change
   -> progon.md

5. vibe coded slides
   told claude what i wanted
   it wrote react components with animations
   iterated until it looked right
   -> slides/

the whole thing is a talk about vibe coding
made with vibe coding
